// What steps along a row in these tests (mbui's sizes_steady.mbt, `sizes_across`: a ground's left edge or width, where
// words start, in one frame, a speed off the frames round it, a dead stop, a turn back again soon), a file at a time: how
// many a Tester made in it may show, as they were found when the check came (2026-11-17). Each only falls: a jump
// mended takes its file's number down, and a file at 0 leaves the list.

///|
fn init {
  sizes_across_known([
    ("src/ui/back_wbtest.mbt", 2),
    ("src/ui/drawn_pivot_wbtest.mbt", 1),
    ("src/ui/layout_wbtest.mbt", 4),
    ("src/ui/list_head_pixels_wbtest.mbt", 1),
    ("src/ui/list_inner_ways_wbtest.mbt", 1),
    ("src/ui/list_stint_wbtest.mbt", 1),
    ("src/ui/list_way_pixels_wbtest.mbt", 1),
    ("src/ui/nav_view_wbtest.mbt", 1),
  ])
}
